ASP.NET_SessionId=xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx; other_cookie=value; ...
# ── How to obtain ──────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Install the cookie-cook browser extension:
#    https://github.com/gaoliang/cookie-cook
# 2. Log in at https://www.nccn.org/login
# 3. Run the extension, pick "Http Header value" from the dropdown, click Copy.
# 4. Paste the single line here, rename this file to `cookie.txt`
#    (remove these comment lines and any blank lines).
#
# cookie.txt is gitignored — it is your live credential, never commit it.
